  "primaryRule": "A planted condition counts as found when the variable is right AND the decision is right. For kind \"existing\", that means the exact value id. For kind \"new\", the reader must NOT map it to any existing value and must propose a new value under that variable; the proposed id is not compared. Precision and recall come from that rule alone.",
